w: Je- sus, ten- der Shep- herd, hear me; Bless Thy lit- tle la- mb to- night;
w: All this day thy hand has led me, And I thank Thee fo- r Thy care;
w: Let my sins be all for- giv- en; Bless the friends I lo- ve so well;
